    "text": "Body of the Leave dialog of a knowledge base in the AI Chat section, shown to a member who is not its owner: a confirmation question, then how to come back. Knowledge base = a room of files the AI assistant searches; never call it a room. Match the term in Common:DeleteKnowledgeBase.",
